  "_comment": "Central raw-channel -> normalized-channel map, applied by the ingest server. channel_raw is always stored, so changing this map and re-deriving `channel` needs no client change and no re-upload. Unknown raw keys pass through unchanged (stored raw, mappable later). Per-VIN overrides go under a VIN key; 'default' applies to all vehicles.",
